  "statement": "# Super Dungeon Delve — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nDescend four generated pixel dungeon floors as a lone knight, trading safety for treasure, and reach the fourth exit alive.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nFour procedurally generated floors with grid movement, directional melee, three enemy kinds, chest and potion pickups, a depth readout, and separate cleared and death endings.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose tile and creature dressing, HUD composition, lighting, and audio while preserving generation, real weapon hitboxes, contact damage, and the four-floor closure.\n"
}
